2026-04-17 16:08:04,460[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-8965b5c1ef466fdf] execute_python_code({"code": "def count_rectangles(short, medium, long, very_long):\n    # Counting rectangles formed by short and long diagonals\n    rectangles_short_long = short * long * 2  # Each pair of short and long diagonals forms 2 rectangles\n    \n    # Counting rectangles formed by medium and very long diagonals\n    rectangles_medium_very_long = medium * very_long * 2  # Each pair of medium and very long diagonals forms 2 rectangles\n    \n    # Counting rectangles formed by combinations of short, medium, and long diagonals\n    rectangles_combinations = (short * medium + short * long + medium * long) * 2  # Each combination of diagonals forms 2 rectangles\n    \n    total_rectangles = rectangles_short_long + rectangles_medium_very_long + rectangles_combinations\n    return total_rectangles\n\ndef count_diagonals(n):\n    # n is the number of sides of the polygon\n    short_diagonals = n * 2 // 6  # 2 diagonals per vertex, but we divide by 6 to avoid double counting\n    medium_diagonals = n * 2 // 6\n    long_diagonals = n * 2 // 6\n    very_long_diagonals = n * 2 // 6\n    return short_diagonals, medium_diagonals, long_diagonals, very_long_diagonals\n\nn = 12\nshort_diagonals, medium_diagonals, long_diagonals, very_long_diagonals = count_diagonals(n)\ntotal_rectangles = count_rectangles(short_diagonals, medium_diagonals, long_diagonals, very_long_diagonals)\ntotal_rectangles"}) - MainThread
