2026-04-17 16:26:34,751[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-883bf5f2b7f1f6e5] execute_python_code({"code": "import cmath\n\n# Define the 13th root of unity\nomega = cmath.exp(2j * cmath.pi / 13)\n\n# Compute the product\nproduct = 1\nfor k in range(13):\n    term = 2 - 2 * omega**k + omega**(2*k)\n    product *= term\n\n# Get the real part of the product (since the imaginary part should be negligible)\nreal_product = round(product.real)\n\n# Find the remainder when the product is divided by 1000\nremainder = real_product % 1000\nremainder", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
