2026-04-17 16:26:49,990[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-abbdbe150c5f344f] execute_python_code({"code": "import math\nfrom itertools import combinations\n\ndef is_rectangle(points):\n    # Sort points to make comparison easier\n    points = sorted(points)\n    # Check if opposite sides are equal and diagonals are equal\n    return (points[0][0] - points[1][0] == points[2][0] - points[3][0] and\n            points[0][1] - points[1][1] == points[2][1] - points[3][1] and\n            (points[0][0] - points[1][0])**2 + (points[0][1] - points[1][1])**2 ==\n            (points[2][0] - points[3][0])**2 + (points[2][1] - points[3][1])**2)\n\n# Vertices of the dodecagon\nvertices = [(math.cos(2*math.pi*i/12), math.sin(2*math.pi*i/12)) for i in range(12)]\n\n# Generate all combinations of 4 points\nrectangles = []\nfor combo in combinations(vertices, 4):\n    if is_rectangle(combo):\n        rectangles.append(combo)\n\n# Number of rectangles\nnum_rectangles = len(rectangles)\nnum_rectangles", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
